  "description": "Dubhe.EmbeddedPostgres.Win-x64 is a zero-configuration, ultra-lightweight embedded PostgreSQL solution for .NET 10.\n\n\t\t  It provides a fully functional database instance out-of-the-box without requiring Docker or a system-wide PostgreSQL installation.\n\t\t  The package includes a high-speed Micro-ORM layer that interacts directly with the native libpq library for maximum performance and minimal memory footprint.\n\n\t\t  Ideal for integration tests, local tools, and rapid prototyping.\n\t\t  Co-authored by AI: This project was architected and developed by Juliaan Vasovsky in creative collaboration with AI (Google Gemini), showcasing a modern approach to high-efficiency software engineering.\n\n\t\t  See README for usage examples.",
  "id": "Dubhe.EmbeddedPostgres.Win-x64",
  "isPrerelease": true,
  "lastEdited": "2026-04-19T17:08:08.22Z",
  "licenseExpression": "PostgreSQL",
