  "packageHash": "mZPSEi1zI9EiOibV/nEekrkef/aPXQSwlw+KXRE01a/8pfs1DUq41Xl2f6oN6g/q+R1XfBc1oZmcsPLHPdMDng==",
  "packageHashAlgorithm": "SHA512",
  "packageSize": 23225348,
  "published": "2026-04-19T17:05:18.927Z",
  "releaseNotes": "v1.0.0-alpha.1:\n\t\t  - Initial public release of the Dubhe Embedded PostgreSQL engine.\n\t\t  - Fully portable: contains optimized PostgreSQL 17.9 binaries for Windows x64 from https://www.enterprisedb.com/download-postgresql-binaries\n\t\t  - High-performance: built-in \"racing car\" Micro-ORM using native libpq.dll (zero-dependency).\n\t\t  - Fluent API: simplified instance configuration and startup.\n\t\t  - ActiveRecord support: easy Create/Read/Update/Delete operations on your entities.\n\t\t  - Built for .NET 10.\n\t\t  - Experimental status: designed for rapid local development and integration testing.\n\t\t  - Linux and macOS support is currently in development.",
